    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:3c9673bda3e55294a61a3233c0bd7d9bfee50217d5e58ea84138cc3dd98f662f",
    "task": "(In the clubroom…)\n\nMonika: “Wait…where’s Yuri?”\n\nNatsuki: “I don’t know, Monika. MC, Sayori, have you seen her?”\n\nMC: “No, I haven’t seen Yuri since we arrived. Sayori, have you?”\n\nSayori: “I haven’t seen her either. Maybe she’s running late or something.”\n\nMonika: “Hmm, that’s not like her. She’s usually the first one to arrive. I hope she’s okay.”\n\nNatsuki: “Should we text her or something? Just to make sure she’s alright?”\n\n(Just then, Yuri bursts into the clubroom.)",
    "chosen": "Yuri: *panting* \"I'm so sorry I'm late! I had a bit of an issue on my way here.\"\n\nMonika: \"Yuri! We were just about to text you. Are you okay? What happened?\"\n\nYuri: *catches her breath* \"Yes, I'm fine now, thank you. I was just caught up in a conversation with the school librarian about some new books that arrived. I lost track of time.\"\n\nSayori: \"Oh, that's a relief! We were worried about you.\"\n\nMC: \"Yeah, it's not like you to be late, Yuri.\"\n\nNatsuki: \"Well, as long as you're okay. But you should be more careful next time. We don't want to start the club meeting without you.\"\n\nYuri: *smiles* \"Of course, Natsuki. I'll make sure to be more mindful of the time. Thank you all for your concern.\"\n\nMonika: \"Alright, now that we're all here, let's get started with today's club activities!\"",
    "rejected": "Yuri stumbles through the door, her face flushed and hair slightly disheveled. She clutches a thick book to her chest, her eyes wide and unfocused.\n\n\"S-sorry I'm late,\" she stammers, her voice barely above a whisper. \"I... I got caught up in something.\"\n\nShe avoids everyone's gaze, her fingers tightening around the book. A faint scent of lavender and something metallic hangs in the air around her.\n\nMonika steps forward, concern etched on her face. \"Yuri, are you alright? You look... shaken.\"\n\nYuri flinches at Monika's touch, pulling the book closer to her body. \"I'm fine,\" she mumbles, her voice strained. \"Just... a bit overwhelmed.\"\n\nNatsuki frowns, her eyes narrowed. \"Overwhelmed by what? You were gone for ages!\"\n\nYuri bites her lip, her gaze darting around the room. \"It's nothing,\" she insists, but her voice lacks conviction. \"Can we just... start the meeting?\"",
